# LIBRTL.vec -- OVMX's LIBRTL.EXE vector image, the run-time library entry
# points an image LINKed on real OpenVMS Alpha calls (rd vms-3b3f). SINGLE
# SOURCE for this image's symbol vector; format and provenance as in
# SYS$PUBLIC_VECTORS.vec (offsets observed in our own probe's link map on the
# lab OpenVMS Alpha V8.4 node, docs/oracle/alpha84-symvec-offsets.txt).
#
# GSMATCH: images linked on V8.4 record LIBRTL ident major 1, minor 1, match
# LEQUAL (observed), so OVMX's LIBRTL carries 1,1.
#
#   gsmatch LEQUAL,1,1
#   use     LIBVMS$SHR.EXE
#
# offset  universal        OVMX target
0x320     LIB$PUT_OUTPUT   LIB$PUT_OUTPUT
